1
00:01:08,729 --> 00:01:10,813
{\an8}- Welcome, Master Ip.
- Welcome, Master Ip.

2
00:01:28,521 --> 00:01:29,563
{\an8}Master Hong.

3
00:01:36,188 --> 00:01:37,854
{\an8}Master Ip,

4
00:01:37,979 --> 00:01:39,021
{\an8}since ancient times,

5
00:01:39,063 --> 00:01:42,938
{\an8}every martial school
has had its own rules.

6
00:01:44,604 --> 00:01:47,104
{\an8}The rule of martial arts in Hong Kong is,

7
00:01:47,146 --> 00:01:50,604
{\an8}you have to pass the initiation test
before opening a martial arts school.

8
00:01:50,729 --> 00:01:51,813
{\an8}Please elaborate.

9
00:01:52,563 --> 00:01:53,729
{\an8}Three trials.

10
00:01:53,854 --> 00:01:55,021
{\an8}Pass them,

11
00:01:55,146 --> 00:01:58,354
{\an8}and all martial schools will recognize you
as the master of the Wing Chun school.

12
00:01:58,896 --> 00:02:00,146
{\an8}Fail,

13
00:02:02,854 --> 00:02:04,354
{\an8}and go back to Foshan!

14
00:02:17,604 --> 00:02:19,688
{\an8}The light shines on one's heart.

15
00:02:21,771 --> 00:02:23,604
{\an8}You show me some leniency,

16
00:02:24,729 --> 00:02:25,979
{\an8}and I'll return the favor.

17
00:02:27,729 --> 00:02:29,021
{\an8}The candles

18
00:02:29,063 --> 00:02:30,271
{\an8}must be kept lit.

19
00:02:30,896 --> 00:02:31,979
{\an8}The oil

20
00:02:32,104 --> 00:02:33,229
{\an8}must be kept contained.

21
00:02:35,104 --> 00:02:36,354
{\an8}Master Ip,

22
00:02:37,688 --> 00:02:38,729
{\an8}please.

23
00:02:40,604 --> 00:02:42,104
{\an8}That's a good rule.

24
00:02:43,354 --> 00:02:46,021
{\an8}If the light goes out or the oil spills,

25
00:02:46,146 --> 00:02:47,396
{\an8}you'll lose all your dignity.

26
00:04:39,771 --> 00:04:41,313
I return the favor.

27
00:04:53,313 --> 00:04:54,854
Good martial arts

28
00:04:54,896 --> 00:04:57,771
isn't about whether you can see it or not.

29
00:04:58,313 --> 00:05:00,896
Kung fu is learned through practice,

30
00:05:01,396 --> 00:05:02,688
not just by watching.

31
00:05:03,271 --> 00:05:06,188
Once you wear the blindfold,
no one can make excuses.

32
00:06:50,521 --> 00:06:51,563
Master Chen,

33
00:06:51,604 --> 00:06:52,854
thank you for your courtesy.

34
00:06:55,146 --> 00:06:55,979
Please.

35
00:07:23,271 --> 00:07:24,729
Incense marks the line.

36
00:07:25,146 --> 00:07:26,438
Fire sets the limit.

37
00:07:27,021 --> 00:07:29,021
Inheritance is the incense.

38
00:07:30,104 --> 00:07:32,188
Rules are the boundary.

39
00:07:33,229 --> 00:07:36,188
You're opening a martial arts school
to carry on this legacy.

40
00:07:36,854 --> 00:07:39,479
But you can't claim the inheritance
without honoring the limits, can you?

41
00:07:39,521 --> 00:07:42,146
Within one stick of incense,
if you can't "dot the eyes,"

42
00:07:42,979 --> 00:07:44,604
don't join the fray.

43
00:07:46,229 --> 00:07:47,271
Master Ip,

44
00:07:48,688 --> 00:07:51,563
don't blame me
for not giving you a chance.

45
00:08:39,396 --> 00:08:40,853
The Golden Lion Breaks the Sky!

46
00:10:24,521 --> 00:10:28,438
Master Hong's rules
are older than this building.

47
00:10:29,646 --> 00:10:30,563
What are you doing here?

48
00:10:36,396 --> 00:10:38,646
Master Ip, you go back first.

49
00:10:39,438 --> 00:10:40,729
The opening of the martial arts school

50
00:10:41,479 --> 00:10:42,771
will be discussed another day.

51
00:10:54,104 --> 00:10:54,979
Goodbye.

52
00:11:01,563 --> 00:11:02,979
Master Hong,

53
00:11:03,104 --> 00:11:05,521
the land for the Zhonghua Building

54
00:11:05,646 --> 00:11:07,396
has been approved
by the Hong Kong government

55
00:11:07,521 --> 00:11:09,271
for my Western boxing gym.

56
00:11:09,604 --> 00:11:10,938
In three days,

57
00:11:11,813 --> 00:11:13,479
would you all please move out?

58
00:11:16,063 --> 00:11:18,563
About the land,
I told you this a long time ago.

59
00:11:18,688 --> 00:11:21,313
The Zhonghua Building is
the root of the martial arts association.

60
00:11:21,354 --> 00:11:23,438
Where will we go if it's torn down?

61
00:11:23,688 --> 00:11:25,854
In the 27th year of the Guangxu reign,

62
00:11:26,938 --> 00:11:30,938
your grandfather borrowed 3,000 taels
from the Hong Kong government.

63
00:11:31,021 --> 00:11:35,146
He mortgaged the Zhonghua Building
and 20 mu of land at the dock.

64
00:11:35,229 --> 00:11:37,979
This debt has been
accruing compound interest.

65
00:11:38,021 --> 00:11:40,688
It's now 30,000 taels.

66
00:11:42,729 --> 00:11:44,646
That promissory note was voided long ago.

67
00:11:44,771 --> 00:11:45,938
The Zhonghua Building

68
00:11:46,063 --> 00:11:47,354
is the ancestral property
of the martial arts association.

69
00:11:47,396 --> 00:11:49,854
What's more,
the authorities personally promised

70
00:11:50,604 --> 00:11:52,104
that it would belong
to the martial arts association forever.

71
00:11:54,771 --> 00:11:55,771
Forever?

72
00:11:56,438 --> 00:12:00,938
Lei Yihu told me
that his mother is in the hospital.

73
00:12:00,979 --> 00:12:03,771
The medical bill is 50 silver dollars.

74
00:12:04,146 --> 00:12:07,104
How much is left
in the martial arts association's account?

75
00:12:11,354 --> 00:12:13,438
Isn't that right, Lei Yihu?

76
00:12:25,438 --> 00:12:26,938
Sign it,

77
00:12:26,979 --> 00:12:29,646
and all debts will be written off.

78
00:12:29,771 --> 00:12:32,438
The Zhonghua Building stays yours,

79
00:12:32,521 --> 00:12:34,854
you remain president
of the martial arts association,

80
00:12:34,979 --> 00:12:36,688
and your disciples will have food to eat.

81
00:12:36,813 --> 00:12:38,021
Refuse to sign,

82
00:12:39,063 --> 00:12:40,604
and you'll be a sinner.

83
00:12:41,563 --> 00:12:44,104
I'll only take the dockland.

84
00:12:44,146 --> 00:12:45,938
In three days,

85
00:12:46,021 --> 00:12:49,729
I want the dock completely empty.

86
00:12:51,896 --> 00:12:53,021
You can leave now.

87
00:13:01,896 --> 00:13:03,021
Master,

88
00:13:03,146 --> 00:13:06,313
are you really not going
to do what the foreigner said?

89
00:13:08,438 --> 00:13:09,688
He said

90
00:13:09,771 --> 00:13:11,771
all they want is Xu Jinsong's dock.

91
00:13:11,896 --> 00:13:13,063
Just nod your head,

92
00:13:13,146 --> 00:13:15,021
and the Zhonghua Building
will still be ours.

93
00:13:15,146 --> 00:13:16,271
Get down on your knees.

94
00:13:25,313 --> 00:13:28,438
There was a famine
in the 25th year of the Republic of China.

95
00:13:28,563 --> 00:13:30,229
It was Xu Jinsong's father

96
00:13:30,813 --> 00:13:32,396
who opened the granaries
and distributed grain.

97
00:13:32,521 --> 00:13:34,396
He saved 30 lives
in the martial arts community.

98
00:13:36,188 --> 00:13:37,396
He said

99
00:13:38,146 --> 00:13:42,354
martial artists and workers
are the roots of the Chinese people.

100
00:13:43,354 --> 00:13:45,688
I've already deeded the dock
to Xu Jinsong.

101
00:13:46,479 --> 00:13:48,229
Now you want me to take it back.

102
00:13:49,271 --> 00:13:50,313
Master,

103
00:13:50,771 --> 00:13:52,771
the martial arts association is
almost out of food.

104
00:13:52,896 --> 00:13:54,979
And my mother needs money
to save her life.

105
00:13:55,063 --> 00:13:56,104
That's enough.

106
00:13:56,229 --> 00:14:01,771
We in the martial arts community kneel
to heaven, to earth, and to our ancestors,

107
00:14:02,271 --> 00:14:03,313
but never to hardship.

108
00:14:03,396 --> 00:14:04,563
Master,

109
00:14:04,646 --> 00:14:06,938
we can't let the rules strangle us.

110
00:14:06,979 --> 00:14:09,021
Right now,
only the foreigners can save us.

111
00:14:09,063 --> 00:14:10,729
They've got plenty of money.

112
00:14:10,854 --> 00:14:12,729
We won't lose out
by cooperating with them!

113
00:14:12,813 --> 00:14:14,354
Foreigners!

114
00:14:14,479 --> 00:14:16,104
That's all you talk about! Foreigners!

115
00:14:16,188 --> 00:14:17,771
You're Chinese!

116
00:14:17,896 --> 00:14:20,646
Their hearts are darker than ink!

117
00:14:20,771 --> 00:14:23,604
Today, they can turn the Zhonghua Building
into a Western mansion.

118
00:14:23,646 --> 00:14:26,771
Tomorrow, they'll turn us Chinese
into their lackeys!

119
00:14:26,854 --> 00:14:28,813
- Master, but my mother--
- Mark my words!

120
00:14:28,854 --> 00:14:30,646
The Zhonghua Building can't be torn down,

121
00:14:31,563 --> 00:14:33,063
the dock can't be sold,

122
00:14:33,146 --> 00:14:35,354
and the workers can't leave.

123
00:14:35,438 --> 00:14:38,521
Otherwise, I'll be committing
a heinous crime!

124
00:14:45,521 --> 00:14:46,604
Yes.

125
00:14:47,396 --> 00:14:48,729
You're right.

126
00:14:51,771 --> 00:14:53,146
A heinous crime?

127
00:14:54,854 --> 00:14:57,104
Watching my mother die
right in front of me

128
00:14:57,229 --> 00:14:59,104
would be the real heinous crime!

129
00:15:15,396 --> 00:15:17,271
Master, this is
our association's account book.

130
00:15:17,354 --> 00:15:19,979
Withdraw all the money from the account.

131
00:15:21,646 --> 00:15:23,313
Sell any valuable items we have.

132
00:15:26,146 --> 00:15:30,396
Let's get Lei Yihu's mother treated first.

133
00:15:30,521 --> 00:15:31,396
GUANGRONG CANAL TRADING COMPANY

134
00:15:31,438 --> 00:15:32,438
I'll take this one.

135
00:15:34,188 --> 00:15:35,021
Slow down.

136
00:15:35,104 --> 00:15:36,563
- There's one more here.
- Xiaoying!

137
00:15:36,604 --> 00:15:38,229
Hurry up and give her a hand!

138
00:15:39,979 --> 00:15:41,354
- Go slowly.
- There's one more crate here.

139
00:15:43,021 --> 00:15:45,896
Director Xu, another group
of refugees has arrived.

140
00:15:52,563 --> 00:15:56,396
YONG'AN WHARF

141
00:15:58,479 --> 00:15:59,521
- Here.
- There's food.

142
00:15:59,604 --> 00:16:00,646
Take it.

143
00:16:00,771 --> 00:16:01,854
- Come on.
- Thank you, sir!

144
00:16:01,938 --> 00:16:04,104
Share among yourselves.
Everyone gets some.

145
00:16:04,188 --> 00:16:05,729
That's all the food we have for today.

146
00:16:05,771 --> 00:16:08,063
But tomorrow, we'll share more.

147
00:16:14,896 --> 00:16:17,688
Director Xu, there are too many refugees.

148
00:16:17,771 --> 00:16:20,854
The grain at the dock
will only last three days.

149
00:16:21,063 --> 00:16:22,646
- What do we do?
- Load it in.

150
00:16:22,729 --> 00:16:23,813
Let's hold on a little longer.

151
00:16:24,854 --> 00:16:27,188
I'll go to the foreign firm later
to plead for help.

152
00:16:27,854 --> 00:16:29,021
There will always be a way.

153
00:16:29,729 --> 00:16:31,604
- Take them to settle down.
- All right.

154
00:16:32,229 --> 00:16:34,229
Let's go. I'll take you inside.

155
00:16:34,354 --> 00:16:35,521
I'll help you.

156
00:16:35,646 --> 00:16:36,729
Master Ip is here.

157
00:16:36,813 --> 00:16:38,063
- Master Ip.
- Master Ip.

158
00:16:38,813 --> 00:16:39,688
Uncle Zhong.

159
00:16:39,813 --> 00:16:40,896
- Master Ip.
- Master Ip.

160
00:16:41,521 --> 00:16:43,479
Brother Ip, is it done?

161
00:16:45,354 --> 00:16:46,854
I've passed the three trials.

162
00:16:46,938 --> 00:16:48,479
There should be no problem.

163
00:16:48,521 --> 00:16:50,229
Of course, there will be no problem!

164
00:16:50,313 --> 00:16:51,354
Definitely no problem.

165
00:16:51,521 --> 00:16:52,646
By the way, Jinsong,

166
00:16:53,688 --> 00:16:57,521
this is my rent and food expenses.

167
00:16:57,604 --> 00:17:00,104
Brother Ip, I understand your situation.

168
00:17:00,729 --> 00:17:02,479
In times like these,
it's not easy for anyone.

169
00:17:03,479 --> 00:17:04,687
You keep the money.

170
00:17:04,812 --> 00:17:06,354
I'll find a place
for your martial arts school.

171
00:17:06,937 --> 00:17:08,229
You don't have to worry about the money.

172
00:17:08,271 --> 00:17:09,354
Yes, we'll help find it.

173
00:17:10,104 --> 00:17:11,854
I'm really sorry to trouble you.

174
00:17:11,937 --> 00:17:14,479
It was all because you protected
my father's goods back in the day

175
00:17:14,521 --> 00:17:16,562
that we have this dock today.

176
00:17:16,604 --> 00:17:17,604
This is great.

177
00:17:17,646 --> 00:17:19,896
From now on, we can
learn martial arts from Master Ip.

178
00:17:21,187 --> 00:17:22,479
Master Ip.

179
00:17:22,562 --> 00:17:24,937
- Master Ip.
- Master Ip.

180
00:17:25,021 --> 00:17:26,687
- Thank you all very much.
- Dad!

181
00:17:28,146 --> 00:17:29,604
A Zhun.

182
00:17:29,688 --> 00:17:30,938
Make way.

183
00:17:31,104 --> 00:17:32,021
There's this crate too.

184
00:17:43,688 --> 00:17:44,729
Dad,

185
00:17:45,479 --> 00:17:48,271
let's have a competition
to see who can assemble this faster!

186
00:17:48,354 --> 00:17:49,354
Sure.

187
00:18:08,688 --> 00:18:10,271
I went to the grain shop today.

188
00:18:10,396 --> 00:18:12,396
Boss Wang said he can't give us
any more rice on credit.

189
00:18:13,146 --> 00:18:16,229
This afternoon, I mended clothes
for someone and earned two copper coins.

190
00:18:18,021 --> 00:18:19,396
It's enough to buy half a bag of rice.

191
00:18:27,438 --> 00:18:28,688
Here.

192
00:18:28,771 --> 00:18:29,729
Give it to me.

193
00:18:33,146 --> 00:18:34,813
Today, Jinsong

194
00:18:34,938 --> 00:18:36,354
didn't accept our rent.

195
00:18:37,771 --> 00:18:38,938
You can buy some rice tomorrow.

196
00:18:41,521 --> 00:18:44,813
When the martial arts school opens,
everything will get better.

197
00:19:03,104 --> 00:19:04,104
Mom,

198
00:19:04,146 --> 00:19:05,521
the medicine is ready.

199
00:19:05,646 --> 00:19:06,563
Come.

200
00:19:08,271 --> 00:19:09,438
Son,

201
00:19:10,313 --> 00:19:12,313
my illness can't be cured.

202
00:19:14,479 --> 00:19:16,604
Don't waste any more money on it.

203
00:19:18,271 --> 00:19:19,479
Mom,

204
00:19:19,521 --> 00:19:21,229
the doctor already said

205
00:19:21,313 --> 00:19:24,271
your illness will be cured
after the operation.

206
00:19:24,729 --> 00:19:26,771
I'll figure out the money.

207
00:19:27,271 --> 00:19:29,396
Drink the medicine first.

208
00:19:29,479 --> 00:19:30,354
Come on.

209
00:19:37,146 --> 00:19:39,229
Your master is being foolish.

210
00:19:39,813 --> 00:19:42,729
The martial arts association's disciples
are starving to death.

211
00:19:43,479 --> 00:19:46,104
He would rather cling to the old debt

212
00:19:46,229 --> 00:19:49,021
owed to Xu Jinsong's father back then,

213
00:19:49,146 --> 00:19:51,229
staring blankly, than take my check.

214
00:19:51,813 --> 00:19:54,854
I know you're a sensible man,

215
00:19:54,938 --> 00:19:56,771
unlike him.

216
00:19:58,146 --> 00:20:00,063
What do you want me to do?

217
00:20:00,146 --> 00:20:01,146
It's simple.

218
00:20:01,979 --> 00:20:04,354
Hong Zhennan refuses to act.

219
00:20:04,479 --> 00:20:05,938
You help him.

220
00:20:06,063 --> 00:20:08,938
Burn the squatter huts,
and drive the workers away.

221
00:20:09,604 --> 00:20:11,521
He's getting old.

222
00:20:11,604 --> 00:20:13,688
It's time for the younger generation
to step up.

223
00:20:14,563 --> 00:20:18,021
And the new master
of the Zhonghua Building

224
00:20:18,688 --> 00:20:19,938
will be you.

225
00:20:20,521 --> 00:20:22,021
Are you going
to demolish the Zhonghua Building?

226
00:20:23,063 --> 00:20:25,563
No.

227
00:20:26,729 --> 00:20:29,271
I'm going to turn it

228
00:20:29,313 --> 00:20:31,604
into a symbol
of the new martial arts association.

229
00:20:32,438 --> 00:20:33,521
In the future,

230
00:20:34,229 --> 00:20:40,146
all martial arts schools in Hong Kong
will come to pay homage to you, Lei Yihu.

231
00:20:45,396 --> 00:20:46,938
You need this check

232
00:20:47,021 --> 00:20:49,688
more than Hong Zhennan does.

233
00:20:49,813 --> 00:20:51,146
As for the amount,

234
00:20:51,688 --> 00:20:53,979
you can fill in any number you want.

235
00:21:35,354 --> 00:21:37,521
Master Ip, it's me, Uncle Zhong.

236
00:21:38,229 --> 00:21:39,313
Master Ip.

237
00:21:39,396 --> 00:21:40,938
Master Ip, are you asleep yet?

238
00:21:42,021 --> 00:21:43,104
Master Ip!

239
00:21:43,771 --> 00:21:45,354
- Master Ip, it's an emergency!
- Uncle Zhong.

240
00:21:45,438 --> 00:21:47,688
Director Xu was kidnapped.

241
00:21:47,771 --> 00:21:48,729
Who did this?

242
00:21:48,813 --> 00:21:50,521
It was the martial arts gang!

243
00:21:50,563 --> 00:21:52,313
- Are you sure?
- Absolutely sure.

244
00:21:52,438 --> 00:21:53,646
I saw it with my own eyes.

245
00:21:53,688 --> 00:21:55,854
Master Ip, come with me quickly!

246
00:21:57,771 --> 00:21:58,729
A-Man.

247
00:22:03,104 --> 00:22:04,771
Take care.

248
00:22:04,896 --> 00:22:06,438
Got it. Look after A Zhun well.

249
00:22:07,396 --> 00:22:08,271
Let's go.

250
00:22:08,354 --> 00:22:09,313
Let's go.

251
00:22:12,854 --> 00:22:14,146
Master Hong,

252
00:22:14,271 --> 00:22:16,021
Xu Jinsong has been kidnapped.

253
00:22:16,104 --> 00:22:17,479
You gave the go-ahead.

254
00:22:19,729 --> 00:22:21,479
Xu Jinsong has been kidnapped?

255
00:22:21,604 --> 00:22:23,063
I saw it with my own eyes.

256
00:22:23,813 --> 00:22:25,729
That gang was wearing
the martial arts association's uniforms.

257
00:22:25,813 --> 00:22:27,146
They were clearly members
of the martial arts association!

258
00:22:28,104 --> 00:22:29,604
When I do things,

259
00:22:29,688 --> 00:22:31,604
I'm always open and aboveboard.

260
00:22:31,688 --> 00:22:33,688
Why would I do such a despicable thing?

261
00:22:33,771 --> 00:22:34,813
Master!

262
00:22:36,854 --> 00:22:39,604
Master, I just saw Senior Brother
leading some men to the dock.

263
00:22:54,104 --> 00:22:56,146
IRREVOCABLE TRANSFER,
SIGNATURE OF TRANSFEROR

264
00:22:57,229 --> 00:22:58,271
Sign here.

265
00:22:58,938 --> 00:23:00,563
Then these 100 taels are yours.

266
00:23:01,229 --> 00:23:04,521
From now on, in the New Territories,
I'll make sure you never go hungry.

267
00:23:06,146 --> 00:23:07,396
This piece of land

268
00:23:08,104 --> 00:23:10,313
was traded to my father
in exchange for grain back then.

269
00:23:13,396 --> 00:23:17,021
Now, it's the lifeline of all my workers.

270
00:23:18,521 --> 00:23:21,146
There was a famine
in the 25th year of the Republic of China.

271
00:23:21,729 --> 00:23:23,271
Master Hong made a promise.

272
00:23:24,646 --> 00:23:26,354
As long as
the martial arts association exists,

273
00:23:27,146 --> 00:23:28,479
this factory will stand.

274
00:23:29,771 --> 00:23:31,063
Lei Yihu,

275
00:23:31,688 --> 00:23:33,688
who the hell do you think you are?

276
00:23:37,854 --> 00:23:39,146
I invited you here

277
00:23:39,229 --> 00:23:40,771
as a sign of respect.

278
00:23:42,021 --> 00:23:43,021
Lei Yihu!

279
00:23:44,104 --> 00:23:45,146
Don't you dare!

280
00:23:51,563 --> 00:23:52,604
Master!

281
00:23:56,021 --> 00:23:57,396
You came at just the right time.

282
00:23:57,479 --> 00:23:59,146
There's something I need to tell you.

283
00:24:00,604 --> 00:24:02,271
I've raised you for ten years.

284
00:24:02,354 --> 00:24:04,063
You know full well I hate foreigners
more than anything.

285
00:24:04,146 --> 00:24:05,896
Yet, you're acting as their lapdog.

286
00:24:05,979 --> 00:24:07,521
You worthless scoundrel.

287
00:24:13,146 --> 00:24:15,938
I've worked tirelessly
for you for ten years.

288
00:24:17,438 --> 00:24:18,729
What did I get in return?

289
00:24:18,813 --> 00:24:19,688
The vice president position was given

290
00:24:19,771 --> 00:24:20,688
to the Chamber of Commerce president's
son-in-law.

291
00:24:20,813 --> 00:24:22,604
The deputy master position was given
to that man surnamed Zhao.

292
00:24:22,646 --> 00:24:26,188
I can't even get the money
to save my mother's life.

293
00:24:27,563 --> 00:24:30,938
All these years,
have you ever praised me?

294
00:24:30,979 --> 00:24:32,354
Even just once?

295
00:24:33,104 --> 00:24:34,563
Just once?

296
00:24:36,271 --> 00:24:37,438
No.

297
00:24:39,313 --> 00:24:40,854
You didn't!

298
00:24:40,938 --> 00:24:43,146
Have you ever thought about how I feel?

299
00:24:43,896 --> 00:24:47,354
Have you ever considered my feelings?

300
00:24:53,604 --> 00:24:56,188
I've only collaborated
with the foreigners for a few days,

301
00:24:56,271 --> 00:24:58,479
and I can already be
on equal terms with you.

302
00:24:58,563 --> 00:24:59,688
Look.

303
00:25:02,146 --> 00:25:05,313
Look at the martial arts association.
What has it become now?

304
00:25:05,854 --> 00:25:07,521
We can't even afford to eat.

305
00:25:07,646 --> 00:25:10,521
There was a brother who stole bread
from the foreigners yesterday,

306
00:25:10,563 --> 00:25:11,896
and his ribs were broken.

307
00:25:12,021 --> 00:25:13,354
It was I who saved him.

308
00:25:14,438 --> 00:25:15,771
And that Xu Jinsong.

309
00:25:16,229 --> 00:25:18,854
His factory is clearly
in our association's territory.

310
00:25:18,896 --> 00:25:20,021
Pike already said so.

311
00:25:20,146 --> 00:25:22,896
He will give you money. It's not
like he won't pay you, Master.

312
00:25:23,021 --> 00:25:24,313
Why do you always...

313
00:25:25,229 --> 00:25:26,271
And...

314
00:25:30,729 --> 00:25:33,188
Master, Pike said,

315
00:25:33,354 --> 00:25:35,521
as long as you sign this,

316
00:25:35,563 --> 00:25:38,688
all the debts owed by the association
will be written off in one go.

317
00:25:38,729 --> 00:25:40,146
You scoundrel.

318
00:25:40,979 --> 00:25:42,646
You're going
to ruin the martial arts association!

319
00:25:46,063 --> 00:25:47,021
Master,

320
00:25:48,063 --> 00:25:49,938
I'm trying to save
the martial arts association.

321
00:25:50,396 --> 00:25:52,646
Your way doesn't work anymore.

322
00:25:52,729 --> 00:25:54,229
You're getting old.

323
00:25:54,563 --> 00:25:56,938
It's time for the younger generation
to step up.

324
00:25:58,438 --> 00:26:00,521
I'll take over from here.

325
00:26:00,563 --> 00:26:03,729
Wouldn't it be better for you
to enjoy your golden years in peace?

326
00:26:03,854 --> 00:26:06,813
Traitor!

327
00:26:07,771 --> 00:26:09,229
All right.

328
00:26:09,354 --> 00:26:11,229
Today, I'll act on behalf of the Hong Clan

329
00:26:11,313 --> 00:26:13,063
to purge the ranks!

330
00:26:14,854 --> 00:26:15,854
Master Hong.

331
00:26:16,396 --> 00:26:17,979
Hong Zhennan,

332
00:26:18,063 --> 00:26:19,646
you forced me.

333
00:26:26,604 --> 00:26:27,813
Close the doors!

334
00:26:30,771 --> 00:26:31,854
Today,

335
00:26:31,979 --> 00:26:33,896
if you refuse to sign,

336
00:26:33,938 --> 00:26:36,271
no one will walk out of here alive.

337
00:26:37,438 --> 00:26:38,813
Master Ip,

338
00:26:38,896 --> 00:26:40,771
I'll deal with this brat.

339
00:26:40,896 --> 00:26:42,979
You take the chance to save Director Xu.

340
00:26:43,063 --> 00:26:43,979
All right.

341
00:26:44,063 --> 00:26:46,396
Master Hong, be careful.

342
00:26:48,479 --> 00:26:49,521
Attack!

343
00:28:06,604 --> 00:28:07,646
You guys attack.

344
00:28:11,604 --> 00:28:12,729
Are you okay?

345
00:28:12,854 --> 00:28:13,688
I'm fine.

346
00:28:15,479 --> 00:28:16,271
You attack.

347
00:28:55,688 --> 00:28:56,604
Brother Hong.

348
00:29:14,313 --> 00:29:15,313
- Move over.
- Go.

349
00:29:15,354 --> 00:29:16,354
- Let's go.
- Stand still.

350
00:29:16,396 --> 00:29:17,479
Behave!

351
00:29:18,271 --> 00:29:19,146
Behave.

352
00:29:19,729 --> 00:29:20,729
Master Ip.

353
00:29:20,813 --> 00:29:22,313
- Are you okay?
- I heard some news.

354
00:29:22,396 --> 00:29:24,479
Someone is looking to stir up trouble.

355
00:29:26,813 --> 00:29:28,188
Madam Mei.

356
00:29:29,104 --> 00:29:31,979
I'm just here with Master
to reminisce about the past.

357
00:29:32,021 --> 00:29:34,021
There is no harm in that, right?

358
00:29:36,104 --> 00:29:37,188
Police.

359
00:29:37,229 --> 00:29:39,229
Drop your weapons.

360
00:29:42,271 --> 00:29:44,813
Do you know who is backing me?

361
00:29:46,271 --> 00:29:47,646
Can you afford to mess with me?

362
00:29:48,896 --> 00:29:49,938
What?

363
00:29:50,021 --> 00:29:51,729
Can you afford to mess with me?

364
00:29:52,271 --> 00:29:54,313
Believe it or not,
I'll kill you right now.

365
00:29:54,438 --> 00:29:55,646
You'll die for nothing.

366
00:29:57,021 --> 00:29:58,313
Come on.

367
00:30:02,729 --> 00:30:04,813
Harmony brings prosperity.

368
00:30:06,396 --> 00:30:09,104
No need to be so serious, madam.

369
00:30:09,229 --> 00:30:10,271
Don't move.

370
00:30:11,313 --> 00:30:12,688
Lei Yihu,

371
00:30:12,813 --> 00:30:15,479
I'm pressing charges
against you for illegal detention

372
00:30:15,563 --> 00:30:16,813
and intentional assault.

373
00:30:18,271 --> 00:30:19,146
Take him away.

374
00:30:19,229 --> 00:30:20,271
Yes, madam.

375
00:30:26,188 --> 00:30:27,854
- Go.
- Hurry up.

376
00:30:38,438 --> 00:30:39,521
Director Xu,

377
00:30:39,646 --> 00:30:40,729
Master Hong,

378
00:30:40,771 --> 00:30:41,979
are you all right?

379
00:30:42,896 --> 00:30:44,854
Thank you, officer.

380
00:30:49,438 --> 00:30:50,646
Master Ip,

381
00:30:51,188 --> 00:30:52,521
put down your weapon.

382
00:30:54,271 --> 00:30:55,354
Right.

383
00:30:56,396 --> 00:30:57,396
Come back to the station with me.

384
00:30:57,438 --> 00:30:58,521
Officer Mei,

385
00:30:59,313 --> 00:31:01,063
this is an internal matter
of the Hong Clan.

386
00:31:01,146 --> 00:31:02,688
It has nothing to do with Master Ip.

387
00:31:02,813 --> 00:31:04,396
- Do you think--
- Master Hong.

388
00:31:04,479 --> 00:31:06,021
I'm just doing my duty.

389
00:31:06,813 --> 00:31:07,854
Would you prefer

390
00:31:09,104 --> 00:31:10,521
I ask you to come voluntarily,

391
00:31:11,229 --> 00:31:12,729
or should I escort you?

392
00:31:19,313 --> 00:31:22,438
KOWLOON POLICE STATION, HONG KONG

393
00:31:32,688 --> 00:31:33,854
They're coming out.

394
00:31:34,438 --> 00:31:35,396
Master Ip is coming out.

395
00:31:35,479 --> 00:31:36,979
- Master Ip.
- Master Ip.

396
00:31:37,021 --> 00:31:38,063
Master Ip.

397
00:31:38,688 --> 00:31:39,813
He's fine.

398
00:31:41,979 --> 00:31:43,271
Are you okay?

399
00:31:43,313 --> 00:31:45,313
- Master Hong, you've suffered.
- Master Hong.

400
00:31:45,354 --> 00:31:46,396
- I'm glad you're fine.
- Brother Ip.

401
00:31:47,229 --> 00:31:50,604
Thanks to Officer Mei's sharp insight,
your names were cleared.

402
00:31:54,271 --> 00:31:55,771
I'm out.

403
00:31:56,813 --> 00:31:58,188
- Brother Hu.
- Brother Hu.

404
00:31:58,354 --> 00:31:59,938
- Brother Hu.
- Master Hong.

405
00:32:12,104 --> 00:32:13,146
Xu Jinsong,

406
00:32:13,771 --> 00:32:15,604
you got lucky last night.

407
00:32:16,604 --> 00:32:19,396
That dock will be mine sooner or later.

408
00:32:20,229 --> 00:32:22,146
Just wait for your demise.

409
00:32:30,438 --> 00:32:31,479
And...

410
00:32:33,271 --> 00:32:35,354
that seat at the martial arts association.

411
00:32:35,646 --> 00:32:38,063
Sooner or later,
it'll be mine, Lei Yihu's.

412
00:32:39,896 --> 00:32:42,229
There'll come a time when you beg me.

413
00:32:42,854 --> 00:32:44,479
Brother Hu, the welcome feast is ready.

414
00:32:47,354 --> 00:32:48,354
Drive.

415
00:32:50,396 --> 00:32:51,271
Let's go.

416
00:32:53,146 --> 00:32:54,104
Stop looking.

417
00:32:54,854 --> 00:32:56,813
The order to release him

418
00:32:56,938 --> 00:33:00,521
was directly issued
by the governor's office.

419
00:33:04,521 --> 00:33:05,896
Pike's men

420
00:33:06,063 --> 00:33:07,396
can't be touched.

421
00:33:07,479 --> 00:33:08,646
Can't be touched?

422
00:33:08,688 --> 00:33:09,688
The blood in the warehouse

423
00:33:09,729 --> 00:33:10,854
and Director Xu's injuries.

424
00:33:10,979 --> 00:33:12,438
Didn't they do all of it?

425
00:33:12,854 --> 00:33:14,646
It's just because
there are foreigners backing them.

426
00:33:14,729 --> 00:33:15,896
Brother Ip,

427
00:33:15,979 --> 00:33:17,063
sorry for this humiliating fiasco.

428
00:33:18,354 --> 00:33:19,396
No.

429
00:33:20,688 --> 00:33:23,521
I must thank you for getting us
out of that predicament today.

430
00:33:24,563 --> 00:33:27,396
Since you were willing to lend a hand
and help me save Director Xu,

431
00:33:27,438 --> 00:33:29,604
I should be the one saying thank you.

432
00:33:30,563 --> 00:33:31,854
It's a shame.

433
00:33:31,979 --> 00:33:33,688
During the lion dance eye-dotting trial,

434
00:33:34,271 --> 00:33:35,771
I deliberately made things
difficult for you.

435
00:33:35,854 --> 00:33:37,854
Martial arts in Hong Kong are struggling.

436
00:33:38,688 --> 00:33:40,896
One more martial arts school means
one less bowl of rice for the others.

437
00:33:41,521 --> 00:33:42,896
I hope you can understand.

438
00:33:43,021 --> 00:33:45,313
Master Hong, I completely understand.

439
00:33:45,396 --> 00:33:46,646
Regarding opening
your martial arts school,

440
00:33:46,729 --> 00:33:48,229
I call the shots.

441
00:33:48,271 --> 00:33:49,313
In three days' time,

442
00:33:49,396 --> 00:33:50,979
we'll hold a banquet
at the Zhonghua Building.

443
00:33:51,104 --> 00:33:53,229
The masters from all the schools
will be there as witnesses!

444
00:33:53,313 --> 00:33:55,229
- All right.
- All right!

445
00:33:56,354 --> 00:33:58,021
- The martial arts school will open!
- At last!

446
00:33:58,688 --> 00:34:01,646
That's just how things are in Hong Kong.

447
00:34:01,771 --> 00:34:04,063
Last month, Old Li, one of our inspectors,

448
00:34:04,146 --> 00:34:06,854
arrested one of Pike's bodyguards.

449
00:34:06,979 --> 00:34:08,063
What happened then?

450
00:34:09,104 --> 00:34:10,104
Three days later,

451
00:34:10,146 --> 00:34:12,438
he was transferred
to guard the garbage dump.

452
00:34:13,604 --> 00:34:16,146
You're the first Chinese
female police officer.

453
00:34:16,229 --> 00:34:18,229
You mustn't mess this up.

454
00:34:20,563 --> 00:34:22,438
I didn't become a police officer

455
00:34:22,563 --> 00:34:24,313
to kowtow to foreigners.

456
00:34:27,146 --> 00:34:28,479
Let me ask you.

457
00:34:29,438 --> 00:34:30,979
Have you ever considered this?

458
00:34:33,938 --> 00:34:36,021
There are people in this police station

459
00:34:36,146 --> 00:34:38,896
who don't want you to pursue this case.

460
00:34:39,354 --> 00:34:42,396
It's not just about the connections
behind the case.

461
00:34:42,438 --> 00:34:43,813
It's also because

462
00:34:43,938 --> 00:34:45,896
you are a woman.

463
00:34:46,021 --> 00:34:47,146
They think

464
00:34:47,229 --> 00:34:48,646
women shouldn't be police officers

465
00:34:48,688 --> 00:34:50,729
and are better off
staying home with their kids.

466
00:34:50,771 --> 00:34:52,688
That does sound harsh,

467
00:34:52,813 --> 00:34:55,813
but that's your real opponent.

468
00:34:59,563 --> 00:35:00,979
As for Lei Yihu,

469
00:35:01,104 --> 00:35:02,688
I'll be waiting for him
to break the law again.

470
00:35:02,771 --> 00:35:04,313
I'll keep a close eye on him,
no matter what.

471
00:35:05,354 --> 00:35:06,354
Of course,

472
00:35:06,938 --> 00:35:08,438
I also want to show them

473
00:35:08,479 --> 00:35:10,521
that women can
not only be police officers,

474
00:35:10,563 --> 00:35:13,354
but they can also be tougher
and more honorable at it than they are.

475
00:35:13,438 --> 00:35:14,438
You.

476
00:35:19,479 --> 00:35:20,479
Hello.

477
00:35:24,938 --> 00:35:26,896
Hello?

478
00:35:31,146 --> 00:35:32,438
It's Pike's lawyer.

479
00:35:33,479 --> 00:35:35,771
He said he's going
to file a complaint against us tomorrow

480
00:35:35,896 --> 00:35:37,438
for illegal detention.

481
00:35:39,021 --> 00:35:40,229
Really?

482
00:35:40,313 --> 00:35:41,313
Let him come.

483
00:35:41,854 --> 00:35:44,604
I will see this through to the end.

484
00:35:52,396 --> 00:35:55,063
Women never give up.

485
00:35:56,479 --> 00:35:58,146
Divide up this area,

486
00:35:58,271 --> 00:36:00,271
and in ten years,

487
00:36:00,354 --> 00:36:03,396
it will become
the Oxford Street of the East.

488
00:36:03,896 --> 00:36:04,896
Cheers!

489
00:36:05,771 --> 00:36:06,771
Yes!

490
00:36:06,813 --> 00:36:10,313
That move by Mr. Pike
was brilliant and ruthless.

491
00:36:12,021 --> 00:36:17,063
It's time for London's business map
to move a little eastward.

492
00:36:17,188 --> 00:36:18,271
Yes!

493
00:36:19,146 --> 00:36:20,438
- Bloody right!
- Pike.

494
00:36:23,771 --> 00:36:25,563
Excuse me, gentlemen.

495
00:36:29,021 --> 00:36:29,813
Look at this.

496
00:36:30,813 --> 00:36:32,271
How is it going?

497
00:36:39,063 --> 00:36:41,896
Hong Zhennan is protecting Xu Jinsong now,

498
00:36:41,979 --> 00:36:43,646
and even Ip Man has gotten involved.

499
00:36:45,063 --> 00:36:46,396
Why not

500
00:36:47,729 --> 00:36:49,563
use witnesses
from the martial arts association?

501
00:36:50,563 --> 00:36:52,146
Kill Hong Zhennan

502
00:36:53,646 --> 00:36:54,979
and pin it on Ip Man.

503
00:36:56,813 --> 00:36:57,854
Two birds with one stone.

504
00:36:58,896 --> 00:37:00,729
Let the fire at the dock

505
00:37:02,021 --> 00:37:03,063
burn even brighter.

506
00:37:47,771 --> 00:37:48,729
A-Man.

507
00:37:54,104 --> 00:37:55,938
Why don't we go back to Foshan?

508
00:38:00,521 --> 00:38:02,229
Director Xu was taken.

509
00:38:03,313 --> 00:38:04,313
I...

510
00:38:05,146 --> 00:38:06,604
couldn't leave him to die.

511
00:38:10,229 --> 00:38:12,438
I just want our whole family
to be safe and sound.

512
00:38:23,646 --> 00:38:24,604
Master!

513
00:38:28,563 --> 00:38:29,729
Who is it?

514
00:38:36,854 --> 00:38:37,896
Officer Mei.

515
00:38:38,854 --> 00:38:40,438
- What's this about?
- Master Ip.

516
00:38:40,521 --> 00:38:41,813
Master Hong is dead.

517
00:38:44,646 --> 00:38:46,104
Someone saw it with their own eyes.

518
00:38:46,188 --> 00:38:48,063
You're the one who killed him.

519
00:38:48,188 --> 00:38:50,396
Please come with me
to cooperate with the investigation.

520
00:38:51,104 --> 00:38:52,396
Take him away.

521
00:38:52,438 --> 00:38:53,479
You...

522
00:39:00,813 --> 00:39:02,271
Everybody, be careful.

523
00:39:06,313 --> 00:39:07,313
Director Xu!

524
00:39:07,396 --> 00:39:08,896
Director Xu, it's an emergency!

525
00:39:09,021 --> 00:39:09,896
Director Xu.

526
00:39:09,979 --> 00:39:11,146
Mrs. Ip, why are you here?

527
00:39:11,771 --> 00:39:13,063
A-Man has been arrested.

528
00:39:29,479 --> 00:39:30,938
Master Ip,

529
00:39:30,979 --> 00:39:33,688
will you find your own lawyer,
or shall the police station assign one?

530
00:39:36,688 --> 00:39:37,938
I didn't kill anyone.

531
00:39:38,646 --> 00:39:41,104
Mrs. Hong saw it with her own eyes.

532
00:39:50,771 --> 00:39:51,771
Master Ip?

533
00:39:59,813 --> 00:40:02,063
The killer was wearing a long black gown

534
00:40:02,188 --> 00:40:03,813
and holding a butterfly sword.

535
00:40:09,479 --> 00:40:10,938
I checked the crime scene carefully.

536
00:40:14,729 --> 00:40:18,313
The murder weapon
is exactly the butterfly sword you use.

537
00:40:23,063 --> 00:40:24,646
We had no grudge against each other.
Why would I?

538
00:40:24,729 --> 00:40:25,604
I believe in you.

539
00:40:26,563 --> 00:40:28,229
But the evidence doesn't.

540
00:40:28,271 --> 00:40:29,771
If I were the killer,

541
00:40:31,063 --> 00:40:32,146
would I be so stupid

542
00:40:32,229 --> 00:40:34,229
as to leave the murder weapon
at the crime scene?

543
00:40:35,021 --> 00:40:36,604
Someone must have set me up.

544
00:40:37,854 --> 00:40:40,271
Madam, do you believe in evidence

545
00:40:41,813 --> 00:40:43,104
or justice?

546
00:40:48,021 --> 00:40:49,063
Master Ip,

547
00:40:50,854 --> 00:40:52,188
I'm a police officer.

548
00:40:54,938 --> 00:40:56,396
I only trust evidence.

549
00:41:23,438 --> 00:41:24,313
It's him.

550
00:41:24,438 --> 00:41:25,563
That's him!

551
00:41:26,104 --> 00:41:27,354
Mrs. Hong,

552
00:41:28,646 --> 00:41:30,354
are you sure you saw his face clearly?

553
00:41:34,938 --> 00:41:36,479
Sort of...

554
00:41:39,104 --> 00:41:40,063
No.

555
00:41:42,771 --> 00:41:45,979
Sir, I keep thinking
there is something more to this case.

556
00:41:46,104 --> 00:41:48,146
I saw Ip Man protecting Master Hong.

557
00:41:48,229 --> 00:41:50,313
They didn't seem
to have a deep-seated grudge.

558
00:41:50,396 --> 00:41:51,396
But...

559
00:41:52,563 --> 00:41:54,021
Sir,

560
00:41:54,729 --> 00:41:56,646
take another look at this crime scene.

561
00:41:57,854 --> 00:42:00,521
I just think this case
was solved too smoothly.

562
00:42:00,646 --> 00:42:02,521
From Mrs. Hong testifying against Ip Man

563
00:42:02,604 --> 00:42:04,229
to this butterfly sword
that was left at the scene,

564
00:42:04,854 --> 00:42:07,021
every piece of evidence seems
to be Ip Man saying,

565
00:42:07,146 --> 00:42:09,438
"I was the one who killed him.
Come arrest me."

566
00:42:09,563 --> 00:42:11,354
What's your deduction?

567
00:42:11,396 --> 00:42:12,438
Mrs. Hong

568
00:42:12,521 --> 00:42:14,229
didn't get a clear look
at the killer's face.

569
00:42:14,646 --> 00:42:17,229
Of course, Ip Man is definitely a suspect.

570
00:42:17,354 --> 00:42:18,646
But,

571
00:42:18,688 --> 00:42:21,104
we can't rule out
that someone deliberately framed him.

572
00:42:26,521 --> 00:42:27,479
Keep investigating.

573
00:42:28,313 --> 00:42:31,313
Now the higher-ups are
paying close attention to this case.

574
00:42:31,438 --> 00:42:34,896
We must not wrong Ip Man,

575
00:42:35,021 --> 00:42:36,896
and even more so,
we must not let the killer get away.

576
00:42:37,688 --> 00:42:38,729
Yes, sir.

577
00:42:38,813 --> 00:42:40,146
- An eye for an eye!
- An eye for an eye!

578
00:42:40,271 --> 00:42:41,563
- A life for a life!
- A life for a life!

579
00:42:41,604 --> 00:42:42,854
- An eye for an eye!
- An eye for an eye!

580
00:42:42,938 --> 00:42:44,021
- A life for a life!
- A life for a life!

581
00:42:44,146 --> 00:42:45,438
- An eye for an eye!
- An eye for an eye!

582
00:42:45,521 --> 00:42:47,604
- Mrs. Ip.
- A life for a life!

583
00:42:47,688 --> 00:42:50,146
- Upstairs.
- She's the murderer's wife!

584
00:42:50,271 --> 00:42:52,979
- A life for a life!
- Back up!

585
00:43:06,729 --> 00:43:08,979
Sir, we'll only be inside for a minute.

586
00:43:09,063 --> 00:43:10,896
Please, do us a favor, won't you?

587
00:43:11,021 --> 00:43:13,854
Officer, could you make an exception?
Let us go in!

588
00:43:14,188 --> 00:43:16,146
Come back in half an hour.

589
00:43:22,771 --> 00:43:24,396
Here. Please make an exception.

590
00:43:27,521 --> 00:43:29,896
It's no use sending you in now.

591
00:43:30,021 --> 00:43:31,688
Someone's already visiting inside.

592
00:43:31,813 --> 00:43:32,854
Someone is visiting?

593
00:43:42,479 --> 00:43:44,146
Master Ip.

594
00:43:51,438 --> 00:43:52,354
Lei Yihu.

595
00:43:53,479 --> 00:43:54,563
What are you doing here?

596
00:43:56,021 --> 00:43:58,521
I came to see you, Master Ip.

597
00:44:04,979 --> 00:44:06,021
Master Hong.

598
00:44:08,104 --> 00:44:09,146
Did you kill Master Hong?

599
00:44:15,396 --> 00:44:16,938
You killed Master Hong!

600
00:44:22,604 --> 00:44:23,688
That's right.

601
00:44:23,729 --> 00:44:25,188
I killed him.

602
00:44:57,104 --> 00:44:59,229
But Hong Kong abides by the law now.

603
00:45:00,438 --> 00:45:02,688
Without evidence, that's slander.

604
00:45:02,771 --> 00:45:03,896
Bastard!

605
00:45:07,938 --> 00:45:09,063
Look at you now.

606
00:45:09,188 --> 00:45:10,521
You can't even save yourself.

607
00:45:11,854 --> 00:45:12,688
Beg me.

608
00:45:13,438 --> 00:45:14,729
As long as you beg me,

609
00:45:14,771 --> 00:45:16,813
I'll get the foreigners to set you free.

610
00:45:18,396 --> 00:45:20,229
Not only will I let you
open a martial arts school,

611
00:45:20,313 --> 00:45:23,354
but I'll also give you
a lot of money and women,

612
00:45:23,438 --> 00:45:24,313
Master Ip.

613
00:45:26,813 --> 00:45:28,313
I'd rather rot in jail

614
00:45:29,354 --> 00:45:32,438
than associate with scum like you.

615
00:45:38,729 --> 00:45:39,771
Master Ip,

616
00:45:41,854 --> 00:45:44,896
do you not care
about your wife and son anymore?

617
00:45:48,271 --> 00:45:50,146
I heard your son

618
00:45:50,229 --> 00:45:53,271
really likes the wooden dummy.

619
00:45:53,313 --> 00:45:54,354
Don't you dare!

620
00:46:02,771 --> 00:46:04,271
What wouldn't I dare?

621
00:46:05,563 --> 00:46:06,563
Ip Man,

622
00:46:07,021 --> 00:46:09,271
I gave you a chance.

623
00:46:17,146 --> 00:46:18,313
Lei Yihu!

624
00:46:21,354 --> 00:46:22,479
Lei Yihu!

625
00:46:24,188 --> 00:46:25,313
Lei Yihu!

626
00:46:39,604 --> 00:46:40,854
Time to go.

627
00:47:03,688 --> 00:47:05,354
Director Xu!

628
00:47:05,438 --> 00:47:06,646
What's wrong?

629
00:47:06,729 --> 00:47:08,771
- Hurry back and check on things.
- What's happening?

630
00:47:08,854 --> 00:47:10,146
Someone is causing trouble at the dock.

631
00:47:10,938 --> 00:47:12,479
- Mrs. Ip.
- Hurry.

632
00:47:13,521 --> 00:47:14,521
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

633
00:47:25,604 --> 00:47:26,604
Sir.

634
00:47:28,104 --> 00:47:30,271
Sir, what's going on?

635
00:47:51,021 --> 00:47:52,938
Go about your own business.

636
00:47:59,354 --> 00:48:01,771
You don't have to do anything.

637
00:48:01,896 --> 00:48:04,563
Just pretend you didn't see it.

638
00:48:05,229 --> 00:48:06,479
God said,

639
00:48:06,646 --> 00:48:11,021
"He who is not with me is against me."

640
00:48:53,563 --> 00:48:55,104
Someone wants you dead,

641
00:48:56,063 --> 00:48:57,104
Master Ip.

642
00:49:01,104 --> 00:49:01,938
Attack.

643
00:49:58,104 --> 00:50:01,771
Sir, how much do they pay you
for this job?

644
00:50:02,563 --> 00:50:04,521
You can get this much money

645
00:50:04,604 --> 00:50:06,396
in exchange for Ip Man's life.

646
00:50:06,438 --> 00:50:08,688
You'll make a killing.

647
00:50:08,771 --> 00:50:11,604
All you have to do is write in the report

648
00:50:11,646 --> 00:50:13,646
that Ip Man died in the riot.

649
00:50:13,979 --> 00:50:16,521
You don't have to worry
about anything else.

650
00:52:43,188 --> 00:52:45,104
Goodness! There's a fire!

651
00:52:46,938 --> 00:52:48,313
Fire!

652
00:52:56,021 --> 00:52:57,229
Put out the fire!

653
00:52:57,271 --> 00:52:58,813
Hurry! Put out the fire!

654
00:54:01,188 --> 00:54:02,479
- Stop!
- Freeze!

655
00:54:02,563 --> 00:54:04,813
- Don't move!
- Drop your weapon! Now!

656
00:54:04,854 --> 00:54:06,896
- You! Back up!
- Back up!

657
00:54:06,938 --> 00:54:09,021
Did you hear me? Step back!

658
00:54:11,271 --> 00:54:12,938
Master Ip, are you all right?

659
00:54:13,646 --> 00:54:14,813
I'm okay.

660
00:54:15,729 --> 00:54:17,021
Take him to the infirmary.

661
00:54:17,188 --> 00:54:18,104
Yes.

662
00:54:23,021 --> 00:54:24,396
Escort them back to their cells!

663
00:54:31,104 --> 00:54:32,896
So much money.

664
00:54:32,979 --> 00:54:35,563
I could never earn this much
in my whole life.

665
00:54:42,979 --> 00:54:44,396
This money

666
00:54:44,438 --> 00:54:47,896
can buy so many nice things.

667
00:54:48,021 --> 00:54:49,146
But

668
00:54:49,813 --> 00:54:52,563
it can't buy the lives
of the Chinese people.

669
00:54:53,521 --> 00:54:55,688
I'm a policeman.

670
00:54:57,729 --> 00:54:58,813
Not a dog!

671
00:55:00,146 --> 00:55:01,188
Okay?

672
00:55:02,438 --> 00:55:03,729
Get out.

673
00:55:07,521 --> 00:55:10,479
I think the position
of Chinese Chief Inspector

674
00:55:11,188 --> 00:55:12,396
is due for a change.

675
00:56:20,521 --> 00:56:21,938
A-Man.

676
00:56:26,979 --> 00:56:28,313
A-Man,

677
00:56:28,396 --> 00:56:29,729
I was so worried about you.

678
00:56:33,813 --> 00:56:35,729
- How are you?
- I'm fine.

679
00:56:56,813 --> 00:56:57,813
Sir,

680
00:56:57,854 --> 00:57:00,354
are the higher-ups really going
to transfer Ip Man to Kennedy Prison?

681
00:57:06,771 --> 00:57:08,104
That's so fast.

682
00:57:09,313 --> 00:57:10,896
I guess it makes sense.

683
00:57:10,979 --> 00:57:13,313
Pike dared to kill so openly.

684
00:57:13,438 --> 00:57:14,688
He must have come prepared.

685
00:57:16,104 --> 00:57:17,354
I'm afraid

686
00:57:18,354 --> 00:57:19,938
the odds are against Ip Man.

687
00:57:20,771 --> 00:57:24,229
The only thing
we can do now to keep him alive

688
00:57:25,146 --> 00:57:26,396
is to exonerate him.

689
00:57:27,021 --> 00:57:28,146
Any new leads?

690
00:57:32,438 --> 00:57:34,938
But the case is already clear.

691
00:57:35,521 --> 00:57:38,021
Ip Man stopped Pike
from demolishing the dock factory,

692
00:57:38,104 --> 00:57:39,521
and Pike is taking revenge.

693
00:57:39,604 --> 00:57:42,396
Can we investigate Pike?

694
00:57:45,771 --> 00:57:47,063
Investigate Pike?

695
00:57:47,146 --> 00:57:48,479
Do you have any evidence?

696
00:57:49,354 --> 00:57:53,063
Besides, he's an honored guest
of the governor's office.

697
00:57:53,146 --> 00:57:55,104
And the British are backing him.

698
00:57:55,146 --> 00:57:57,063
We can't investigate him

699
00:57:57,188 --> 00:57:59,521
or Lei Yihu.

700
00:58:00,438 --> 00:58:02,688
So do we just stand by
watching him twist the truth

701
00:58:02,771 --> 00:58:04,104
and kill innocent people at will?

702
00:58:06,604 --> 00:58:10,438
We need to understand our situation now.

703
00:58:10,979 --> 00:58:14,521
I suggest you take a temporary leave

704
00:58:14,646 --> 00:58:17,271
and stay out of this investigation.

705
00:58:17,354 --> 00:58:20,563
Otherwise, you won't
be able to protect yourself.

706
00:58:28,979 --> 00:58:30,563
Having put on this police uniform,

707
00:58:30,646 --> 00:58:32,646
I don't seek to save my own skin.

708
00:58:35,063 --> 00:58:36,771
A policeman's mission

709
00:58:37,146 --> 00:58:39,188
is to speak up for those who were wronged

710
00:58:39,938 --> 00:58:42,896
and fight for justice for the innocent.

711
00:58:43,688 --> 00:58:45,729
We need to show them through our actions

712
00:58:45,854 --> 00:58:48,979
that justice will surely prevail.

713
00:58:52,188 --> 00:58:53,479
If I were afraid of death,

714
00:58:56,396 --> 00:58:58,188
I would never have put on this uniform.

715
00:59:11,188 --> 00:59:12,313
The dock is gone.

716
00:59:12,979 --> 00:59:14,521
Isn't that as good as cutting off
our means of living?

717
00:59:15,313 --> 00:59:17,104
What right do foreigners have
to burn down our factories?

718
00:59:17,229 --> 00:59:18,688
Exactly! No one is doing
anything about it!

719
00:59:18,771 --> 00:59:20,563
Can't even the rule of law rein them in?

720
00:59:21,604 --> 00:59:22,896
The rule of law?

721
00:59:22,979 --> 00:59:24,688
The government is waiting
for Pike's money for the election.

722
00:59:24,729 --> 00:59:26,646
Why would they care
about the lives of ordinary people?

723
00:59:28,479 --> 00:59:30,563
Better to fight
than to suffer in cowardice!

724
00:59:30,688 --> 00:59:31,521
Let's fight them!

725
00:59:31,604 --> 00:59:34,313
- Yes, fight them!
- Yes, fight them!

726
00:59:34,396 --> 00:59:36,188
- I'll risk my life for it!
- Fight them!

727
00:59:37,313 --> 00:59:40,104
Director Xu, say something!

728
00:59:45,229 --> 00:59:46,604
The foreigners have too much power.

729
00:59:47,354 --> 00:59:48,646
Aren't you scared?

730
00:59:48,979 --> 00:59:50,729
What do we have to fear?

731
00:59:50,771 --> 00:59:52,438
Going to jail is better
than starving to death.

732
00:59:52,563 --> 00:59:54,896
Even if we can't get the factory back,
we still need to seek justice!

733
00:59:54,938 --> 00:59:56,688
Yes, seek justice!

734
00:59:56,771 --> 00:59:58,896
- Yes, seek justice!
- Yes, seek justice!

735
00:59:59,021 --> 01:00:00,604
- Seek justice!
- Seek justice!

736
01:00:04,479 --> 01:00:05,396
Director Xu,

737
01:00:05,521 --> 01:00:07,396
why aren't you saying anything?

738
01:00:07,438 --> 01:00:08,688
That's right, Director Xu!

739
01:00:16,104 --> 01:00:18,313
I believe heaven never abandons people.

740
01:00:18,396 --> 01:00:20,896
As long as we unite as one,
there will always be a way.

741
01:00:22,771 --> 01:00:24,354
We can't let others bully us arbitrarily!

742
01:00:24,438 --> 01:00:26,396
Right! We can't let others
bully us arbitrarily!

743
01:00:26,479 --> 01:00:29,354
- Fight them!
- Fight them!

744
01:00:32,521 --> 01:00:34,271
Give us back our factory!

745
01:00:34,354 --> 01:00:35,563
- Give us back our factory!
- Give us back our factory!

746
01:00:35,604 --> 01:00:36,813
Abolish injustice!

747
01:00:36,896 --> 01:00:38,271
- Abolish injustice!
- Abolish injustice!

748
01:00:38,396 --> 01:00:39,688
Punish the gangsters!

749
01:00:39,729 --> 01:00:41,229
- Punish the gangsters!
- Punish the gangsters!

750
01:00:41,354 --> 01:00:42,688
Give us back our factory!

751
01:00:42,813 --> 01:00:44,188
- Give us back our factory!
- Give us back our factory!

752
01:00:44,354 --> 01:00:46,188
- Abolish injustice!
- Abolish injustice!

753
01:00:46,271 --> 01:00:48,021
Hurry up and drive them away.

754
01:00:48,063 --> 01:00:50,104
- Punish the gangsters!
- Punish the gangsters!

755
01:00:50,146 --> 01:00:53,229
- Give us back our factory!
- Give us back our factory!

756
01:00:53,271 --> 01:00:54,854
Abolish injustice!

757
01:00:54,938 --> 01:00:56,354
- Abolish injustice!
- Abolish injustice!

758
01:00:56,396 --> 01:00:57,521
Punish the gangsters!

759
01:00:57,646 --> 01:00:58,479
- Punish the gangsters!
- Punish the gangsters!

760
01:00:58,563 --> 01:01:01,021
- Give us back our factory!
- Give us back our factory!

761
01:01:01,104 --> 01:01:02,104
Abolish injustice!

762
01:01:02,188 --> 01:01:04,563
- What are you yelling about?
- Abolish injustice!

763
01:01:10,771 --> 01:01:11,813
Xu Jinsong,

764
01:01:12,813 --> 01:01:14,979
I think you must be tired of living.

765
01:01:15,771 --> 01:01:17,188
This is the man.

766
01:01:17,229 --> 01:01:18,729
His name is Lei Yihu.

767
01:01:19,313 --> 01:01:21,313
He colluded with gangsters,
burned our dock,

768
01:01:21,396 --> 01:01:22,896
and tried to seize our land!

769
01:01:22,979 --> 01:01:24,021
This is the man!

770
01:01:24,104 --> 01:01:25,396
- That's him.
- That's him.

771
01:01:25,521 --> 01:01:26,604
- Lapdog!
- That's him!

772
01:01:27,813 --> 01:01:29,271
Is this true?

773
01:01:31,854 --> 01:01:32,938
Come on.

774
01:01:33,063 --> 01:01:34,938
Get a clear shot!

775
01:01:36,771 --> 01:01:39,604
I would like to see
who is tired of living.

776
01:01:39,688 --> 01:01:41,188
Snatch that camera from him!

777
01:01:42,146 --> 01:01:43,229
- Give it to me!
- What are you doing?

778
01:01:43,271 --> 01:01:45,563
And what are you all fussing about?

779
01:01:45,646 --> 01:01:47,396
Tell me what is happening here.

780
01:01:54,521 --> 01:01:55,479
Mr. Pike,

781
01:01:55,563 --> 01:01:57,354
some people say
you're colluding with gangsters,

782
01:01:57,438 --> 01:01:58,854
seizing the dock, and assaulting citizens.

783
01:01:58,896 --> 01:01:59,896
What's this about?

784
01:02:01,021 --> 01:02:02,229
That's nonsense.

785
01:02:02,313 --> 01:02:05,063
Then how do you explain
the gangsters who just ran away?

786
01:02:05,146 --> 01:02:07,229
Gangsters? What gangsters?

787
01:02:10,271 --> 01:02:11,188
Foreign devil,

788
01:02:11,896 --> 01:02:12,729
stop pretending.

789
01:02:12,896 --> 01:02:14,854
You're the one who ordered it.

790
01:02:14,979 --> 01:02:16,646
You told Lei Yihu to burn our dock,

791
01:02:16,771 --> 01:02:18,729
framed Master Ip, and put him in prison.

792
01:02:18,854 --> 01:02:20,479
Release him at once!

793
01:02:20,563 --> 01:02:21,813
Give us back our dock!

794
01:02:21,854 --> 01:02:23,813
- Give us back our dock!
- Give us back our dock!

795
01:02:25,479 --> 01:02:27,604
I don't know what you're talking about.

796
01:02:27,729 --> 01:02:30,146
If you have any questions,
contact my lawyer. Okay?

797
01:02:32,313 --> 01:02:33,438
Don't go!

798
01:02:33,521 --> 01:02:36,479
- Don't go!
- Don't go!

799
01:02:36,604 --> 01:02:39,521
- Release Master Ip!
- Release Master Ip!

800
01:02:41,646 --> 01:02:42,813
Hurry! Keep up!

801
01:02:42,896 --> 01:02:43,896
Move faster!

802
01:02:44,021 --> 01:02:44,813
Quickly!

803
01:02:45,813 --> 01:02:47,188
Master Ip,

804
01:02:47,313 --> 01:02:48,854
the dock factory is gone.

805
01:02:51,479 --> 01:02:52,521
I'm sorry.

806
01:02:53,021 --> 01:02:54,688
I couldn't help you.

807
01:02:55,646 --> 01:02:57,479
It must have been Lei Yihu again.

808
01:02:58,604 --> 01:03:00,021
He killed Master Hong too.

809
01:03:01,396 --> 01:03:02,646
He killed Master Hong?

810
01:03:18,938 --> 01:03:20,104
Mr. Pike.

811
01:03:20,646 --> 01:03:21,813
Don't worry.

812
01:03:21,938 --> 01:03:23,979
I'll take care of all those journalists.

813
01:03:24,063 --> 01:03:25,313
I guarantee that tomorrow,

814
01:03:25,354 --> 01:03:27,188
there won't be a word
about this in the newspapers.

815
01:03:29,521 --> 01:03:30,479
Lord,

816
01:03:31,438 --> 01:03:32,604
please forgive me.

817
01:03:32,646 --> 01:03:34,188
I'm about to take a life.

818
01:03:34,813 --> 01:03:36,396
It's what I have to do.

819
01:03:37,271 --> 01:03:38,229
Amen.

820
01:03:39,896 --> 01:03:40,938
Lei Yihu,

821
01:03:41,521 --> 01:03:42,396
go on your way.

822
01:03:44,104 --> 01:03:45,146
Go.

823
01:03:51,146 --> 01:03:52,438
God bless us.

824
01:04:39,646 --> 01:04:41,104
Why did you let him get away?

825
01:04:41,688 --> 01:04:43,479
Why didn't you kill him?

826
01:04:44,021 --> 01:04:46,604
You only paid enough to kill Ip Man.

827
01:04:47,604 --> 01:04:48,688
To kill him,

828
01:04:49,688 --> 01:04:50,771
you have to pay more.

829
01:04:51,813 --> 01:04:52,854
Fuck you.

830
01:04:54,938 --> 01:05:00,313
KENNEDY PRISON, HONG KONG

831
01:05:02,521 --> 01:05:03,354
Get out!

832
01:05:04,063 --> 01:05:05,604
- Hurry up!
- Hurry!

833
01:05:07,479 --> 01:05:08,479
Hurry!

834
01:05:10,021 --> 01:05:11,104
Hurry!

835
01:05:17,104 --> 01:05:18,438
Master Ip,

836
01:05:18,563 --> 01:05:19,938
Mei Lihua asked me to look out for you.

837
01:05:20,563 --> 01:05:23,646
As long as you behave,
I won't give you a hard time.

838
01:05:25,146 --> 01:05:26,188
Let's go.

839
01:06:44,354 --> 01:06:45,354
A Zhun,

840
01:06:46,229 --> 01:06:47,396
make a wish.

841
01:06:55,813 --> 01:06:57,854
- Happy birthday!
- Happy birthday!

842
01:07:00,979 --> 01:07:03,104
A Zhun, what wish did you make?

843
01:07:03,271 --> 01:07:05,521
I wish that Dad would come back soon

844
01:07:05,646 --> 01:07:07,229
to celebrate my birthday with me.

845
01:07:08,479 --> 01:07:09,521
A Zhun,

846
01:07:10,354 --> 01:07:11,396
your dad isn't here right now.

847
01:07:11,479 --> 01:07:13,313
Why don't I celebrate with you?

848
01:07:15,104 --> 01:07:18,646
Uncle Xu, when it's my birthday,
can I have cake too?

849
01:07:18,688 --> 01:07:19,688
Of course.

850
01:07:19,729 --> 01:07:21,063
You'll all get some.

851
01:07:21,104 --> 01:07:24,479
Uncle Xu, I'm hungry.
Can we eat the cake now?

852
01:07:24,604 --> 01:07:25,896
Sure.

853
01:07:25,979 --> 01:07:27,604
Kids eat first.

854
01:07:31,979 --> 01:07:33,271
Here you go, Xiaomin.

855
01:07:38,479 --> 01:07:39,896
Go out and play.

856
01:07:40,021 --> 01:07:41,604
- Slow down.
- Slow down, you guys.

857
01:07:45,771 --> 01:07:47,438
- Come and catch me!
- I'll get you!

858
01:07:49,979 --> 01:07:51,354
I'll get you!

859
01:07:51,479 --> 01:07:52,521
Mrs. Ip,

860
01:07:53,771 --> 01:07:55,146
I'm the one who got Brother Ip involved.

861
01:07:55,229 --> 01:07:56,729
But don't worry.

862
01:07:56,813 --> 01:08:00,354
As long as I'm still breathing,
I'll definitely get him out.

863
01:08:00,438 --> 01:08:01,396
Come on!

864
01:08:02,438 --> 01:08:03,479
Wait.

865
01:08:03,563 --> 01:08:04,979
It looks like someone is missing.

866
01:08:07,396 --> 01:08:08,688
A Zhun is gone!

867
01:08:13,104 --> 01:08:14,188
A Zhun!

868
01:08:17,603 --> 01:08:18,813
A Zhun!

869
01:08:22,978 --> 01:08:24,271
A Zhun.

870
01:08:24,313 --> 01:08:25,396
A Zhun is missing.

871
01:08:26,978 --> 01:08:27,938
Just five minutes.

872
01:08:28,021 --> 01:08:29,063
Thank you.

873
01:08:31,896 --> 01:08:33,813
Brother Ip, how is your injury?

874
01:08:35,103 --> 01:08:36,813
I'm okay. It's much better.

875
01:08:40,103 --> 01:08:41,813
You came so late at night.

876
01:08:41,938 --> 01:08:42,853
What's the matter?

877
01:08:45,353 --> 01:08:46,313
Brother Ip,

878
01:08:47,271 --> 01:08:48,728
I'm sorry.

879
01:08:49,563 --> 01:08:50,813
A Zhun...

880
01:08:51,938 --> 01:08:53,313
A Zhun is missing.

881
01:08:55,563 --> 01:08:56,603
A Zhun.

882
01:09:29,896 --> 01:09:31,103
Ip Man.

883
01:09:31,228 --> 01:09:32,271
Ip Man.

884
01:09:57,813 --> 01:09:59,104
Brother Ip, you...

885
01:10:01,021 --> 01:10:02,229
We still haven't found him.

886
01:10:13,354 --> 01:10:14,396
Yongcheng.

887
01:10:26,771 --> 01:10:27,979
Don't worry.

888
01:10:29,813 --> 01:10:32,438
We will definitely find A Zhun.

889
01:11:02,896 --> 01:11:04,104
Master Ip.

890
01:11:12,063 --> 01:11:13,771
I've been looking for you for a long time.

891
01:11:18,229 --> 01:11:19,563
Jinsong!

892
01:11:19,646 --> 01:11:20,563
Director Xu!

893
01:12:02,396 --> 01:12:03,521
A-Man!

894
01:12:03,604 --> 01:12:05,063
Hurry and take Director Xu
to the hospital.

895
01:12:05,188 --> 01:12:06,021
Go!

896
01:12:07,771 --> 01:12:08,604
Go!

897
01:12:15,479 --> 01:12:16,521
Director Xu.

898
01:12:16,646 --> 01:12:17,646
Director Xu!

899
01:12:18,021 --> 01:12:19,063
Director Xu!

900
01:12:20,813 --> 01:12:22,021
Somebody, please come!

901
01:12:22,938 --> 01:12:24,729
Is anyone here?

902
01:12:26,063 --> 01:12:27,313
Director Xu!

903
01:12:31,021 --> 01:12:32,729
Somebody, please!

904
01:13:32,479 --> 01:13:35,604
What if something happens to Director Xu?

905
01:13:36,854 --> 01:13:37,938
Uncle Zhong.

906
01:13:39,646 --> 01:13:41,271
Director Xu will be fine.

907
01:13:45,604 --> 01:13:46,646
Dad!

908
01:13:46,729 --> 01:13:47,771
Mom!

909
01:13:52,938 --> 01:13:54,188
A Zhun!

910
01:13:54,813 --> 01:13:55,896
- Where have you been?
- A Zhun.

911
01:13:56,021 --> 01:13:57,646
You scared me half to death.

912
01:13:57,688 --> 01:13:59,229
I was scared to death.

913
01:13:59,854 --> 01:14:01,021
Master Ip.

914
01:14:03,188 --> 01:14:04,979
Lei Yihu has been caught.

915
01:14:25,563 --> 01:14:27,896
Lei Yihu, you won't get away.

916
01:14:28,938 --> 01:14:30,104
It's easy to catch me,

917
01:14:30,813 --> 01:14:31,979
but only I have

918
01:14:33,396 --> 01:14:34,938
evidence against Pike.

919
01:14:38,646 --> 01:14:39,938
Why should I trust you?

920
01:14:48,938 --> 01:14:49,771
A Zhun?

921
01:14:49,854 --> 01:14:50,979
As long as you don't arrest me,

922
01:14:51,896 --> 01:14:54,979
I'll give you
both the evidence and the kid.

923
01:14:56,021 --> 01:14:59,104
These are enough to lock him up for life.

924
01:15:01,104 --> 01:15:04,438
FILING ENVELOPE

925
01:15:04,563 --> 01:15:05,396
In here

926
01:15:05,479 --> 01:15:07,021
is all the evidence against Pike.

927
01:15:11,354 --> 01:15:12,271
OPERATING ROOM

928
01:15:18,229 --> 01:15:20,521
- Doctor, how is he?
- How did it go?

929
01:15:42,896 --> 01:15:44,104
I know everyone is having a hard time.

930
01:15:45,063 --> 01:15:46,229
There's no rice left in the rice jar.

931
01:15:47,604 --> 01:15:48,688
The children at home

932
01:15:49,646 --> 01:15:52,021
are crying for their parents
because they're hungry.

933
01:15:55,688 --> 01:15:57,479
But what I want to say today is,

934
01:15:58,521 --> 01:16:00,854
as long as we're willing to work,
there's always hope!

935
01:16:02,188 --> 01:16:03,729
Hope that one day,

936
01:16:04,438 --> 01:16:06,229
every worker will have enough to eat.

937
01:16:07,063 --> 01:16:08,188
That everyone

938
01:16:08,938 --> 01:16:10,979
no longer has to worry
about making a living

939
01:16:11,021 --> 01:16:12,604
and no longer has to worry
about the future.

940
01:16:14,979 --> 01:16:16,813
We don't live for anyone else.

941
01:16:16,938 --> 01:16:17,813
We live for ourselves

942
01:16:18,604 --> 01:16:19,438
and for our families.

943
01:16:20,896 --> 01:16:23,938
For one day in the future
when we meet our ancestors,

944
01:16:25,271 --> 01:16:26,313
we'll have a good explanation
to give them.

945
01:16:37,729 --> 01:16:40,188
- Director Xu!
- Director Xu!

946
01:16:41,396 --> 01:16:43,896
- Director Xu!
- Director Xu!

947
01:16:57,896 --> 01:16:59,188
Uncle Xu!

948
01:17:00,938 --> 01:17:03,104
Uncle Xu!

949
01:17:06,063 --> 01:17:08,771
Uncle Xu!

950
01:17:09,813 --> 01:17:12,438
Officer Mei, can this evidence

951
01:17:13,063 --> 01:17:14,563
bring Pike to justice?

952
01:17:15,063 --> 01:17:18,729
The law...
will deal him a severe sentence.

953
01:17:21,146 --> 01:17:22,271
A severe sentence?

954
01:17:24,896 --> 01:17:27,063
Before Xu Jinsong died,

955
01:17:27,729 --> 01:17:29,396
he only wanted this group of workers

956
01:17:29,479 --> 01:17:31,021
to have a full meal.

957
01:17:32,604 --> 01:17:33,896
Now that he's dead,

958
01:17:36,438 --> 01:17:38,021
Pike will only get a severe sentence?

959
01:17:40,938 --> 01:17:43,104
We used to be bullied by the Japanese.

960
01:17:45,896 --> 01:17:47,354
And now,

961
01:17:47,563 --> 01:17:48,938
we're bullied by foreigners again.

962
01:17:51,063 --> 01:17:52,063
When will these days

963
01:17:55,521 --> 01:17:57,063
come to an end?

964
01:17:59,354 --> 01:18:00,396
Master Ip,

965
01:18:00,479 --> 01:18:01,729
we have nothing to lose.

966
01:18:02,646 --> 01:18:04,396
We'll trade our lives for Pike's!

967
01:18:04,521 --> 01:18:11,771
- We'll trade our lives for Pike's!
- We'll trade our lives for Pike's!

968
01:18:12,521 --> 01:18:13,938
Uncle Xu!

969
01:18:25,563 --> 01:18:26,438
Jinsong,

970
01:18:27,188 --> 01:18:29,646
you said you wanted
to see the Chinese free from bullying.

971
01:18:30,604 --> 01:18:31,688
I'll see it for you,

972
01:18:32,729 --> 01:18:34,521
but not by waiting.

973
01:18:34,604 --> 01:18:35,563
By fighting for it!

974
01:18:36,854 --> 01:18:38,938
The justice that the law can't give,

975
01:18:40,688 --> 01:18:42,063
I'll take with my fists!

976
01:19:11,229 --> 01:19:16,479
ZHONGHUA BUILDING

977
01:19:38,313 --> 01:19:40,896
"He who knows the times is a wise man."

978
01:19:40,979 --> 01:19:44,063
If Master Hong had understood this truth,

979
01:19:44,229 --> 01:19:46,063
he wouldn't have ended up like this.

980
01:19:50,479 --> 01:19:52,563
Isn't that right, Master Zhao?

981
01:19:55,979 --> 01:19:57,396
{\an8}Sign it.

982
01:19:57,521 --> 01:19:59,938
{\an8}This is the only way out
for the martial arts association.

983
01:20:00,021 --> 01:20:00,896
{\an8}TRANSFER CONTRACT

984
01:20:01,521 --> 01:20:02,729
- Don't sign it, Master Zhao!
- Don't sign it, Master Zhao!

985
01:20:02,813 --> 01:20:04,938
- Don't sign it!
- You really can't sign it!

986
01:20:07,479 --> 01:20:10,604
If you're worried about not having work,

987
01:20:10,646 --> 01:20:13,938
you can come here to clean.

988
01:20:14,021 --> 01:20:16,854
- Clean?
- You can also practice boxing.

989
01:20:21,813 --> 01:20:22,896
Damn foreign devil!

990
01:20:25,188 --> 01:20:28,354
Western boxing is real martial arts!

991
01:20:28,479 --> 01:20:29,396
Stop!

992
01:20:31,104 --> 01:20:32,479
Master Hong is gone.

993
01:20:33,188 --> 01:20:36,563
The martial arts association
has become what it is now.

994
01:20:38,438 --> 01:20:39,729
I never wanted

995
01:20:40,479 --> 01:20:43,896
the martial arts association
to fall apart like this in my hands.

996
01:20:43,938 --> 01:20:44,979
Good.

997
01:20:47,896 --> 01:20:48,896
- You can't sign it!
- You can't sign it!

998
01:20:49,021 --> 01:20:49,979
Don't sign it!

999
01:20:50,188 --> 01:20:52,229
- Master Zhao!
- Don't sign it!

1000
01:20:52,271 --> 01:20:53,563
- Master Zhao!
- Master Zhao!

1001
01:20:53,646 --> 01:20:55,104
You really can't sign it, Master Zhao!

1002
01:20:55,188 --> 01:20:55,979
Master Zhao.

1003
01:21:14,104 --> 01:21:15,188
- Master Ip.
- Master Ip.

1004
01:21:16,229 --> 01:21:17,104
Ip Man?

1005
01:21:18,104 --> 01:21:19,854
You're not dead!

1006
01:21:19,938 --> 01:21:20,979
No thanks to you.

1007
01:21:23,229 --> 01:21:25,438
Master Zhao, have you
really made up your mind?

1008
01:21:26,396 --> 01:21:29,813
Master Ip, endure for a moment,
and all will be calm.

1009
01:21:29,938 --> 01:21:32,604
Take a step back,
and there will be a boundless sky.

1010
01:21:32,979 --> 01:21:35,271
Endure? How long can we endure?

1011
01:21:37,271 --> 01:21:38,646
Endure until our families are destroyed?

1012
01:21:41,479 --> 01:21:42,313
Master Zhao,

1013
01:21:43,313 --> 01:21:45,188
fairness isn't earned by enduring.

1014
01:21:45,646 --> 01:21:46,979
For those who practice martial arts,

1015
01:21:47,521 --> 01:21:49,063
when it's time to raise our fists,

1016
01:21:49,229 --> 01:21:50,354
we must raise them.

1017
01:21:50,813 --> 01:21:51,729
Fists?

1018
01:21:53,896 --> 01:21:55,563
Do fists even work?

1019
01:21:55,646 --> 01:21:56,604
At least,

1020
01:21:57,104 --> 01:21:58,938
our fists can feed us.

1021
01:22:00,521 --> 01:22:01,979
If the world is unfair,

1022
01:22:03,354 --> 01:22:04,604
fists are justice!

1023
01:22:05,896 --> 01:22:07,354
That's right.
What Master Ip said is right.

1024
01:22:07,479 --> 01:22:09,688
If the world is unfair, fists are justice!

1025
01:22:09,813 --> 01:22:13,771
- Fists are justice!
- Fists are justice!

1026
01:22:15,604 --> 01:22:16,646
Pike,

1027
01:22:17,354 --> 01:22:18,938
you failed to take over the dock,

1028
01:22:19,021 --> 01:22:21,938
and now you're here
to take over the Zhonghua Building.

1029
01:22:22,063 --> 01:22:24,396
Don't talk about a mere dock.

1030
01:22:24,813 --> 01:22:28,063
The entirety of Hong Kong
belongs to the British Empire.

1031
01:22:28,438 --> 01:22:30,896
I can demolish whatever I want,
wherever I want!

1032
01:22:31,438 --> 01:22:35,313
Did your British government
tell you to kill, set fires,

1033
01:22:35,396 --> 01:22:36,438
and oppress the people?

1034
01:22:37,104 --> 01:22:39,396
I don't know what you're talking about.

1035
01:22:39,521 --> 01:22:40,896
You failed to seize the dock,

1036
01:22:41,563 --> 01:22:43,688
so you told Lei Yihu to kill Master Hong

1037
01:22:43,729 --> 01:22:44,771
and frame me for it!

1038
01:22:44,813 --> 01:22:46,438
Afraid I would expose your secrets,

1039
01:22:46,563 --> 01:22:49,729
you sent Golden Leopard
to silence me several times.

1040
01:22:50,271 --> 01:22:52,813
Not only that,
you set fire to the squatter huts

1041
01:22:53,188 --> 01:22:54,396
and killed Director Xu!

1042
01:22:55,188 --> 01:22:59,354
Now, I'm here
to demand justice for the dead!

1043
01:23:00,229 --> 01:23:02,479
What do you think justice is?

1044
01:23:03,521 --> 01:23:04,563
I'll tell you.

1045
01:23:07,688 --> 01:23:10,479
The winner is justice.

1046
01:23:11,854 --> 01:23:12,854
Okay?

1047
01:23:13,396 --> 01:23:16,604
You also say that fists are justice.

1048
01:23:16,729 --> 01:23:19,063
Don't say I didn't give you a chance.

1049
01:23:19,396 --> 01:23:23,063
Whoever can defeat our Western boxers

1050
01:23:23,313 --> 01:23:26,438
can take this land deed.

1051
01:23:27,563 --> 01:23:28,521
James!

1052
01:23:29,271 --> 01:23:30,063
Come in!

1053
01:23:59,313 --> 01:24:00,604
So it's all right?

1054
01:24:01,104 --> 01:24:03,313
Just do whatever you have to do.

1055
01:24:07,104 --> 01:24:08,188
Who's first?

1056
01:24:09,229 --> 01:24:10,188
Master Ip.

1057
01:24:14,313 --> 01:24:15,354
I'll go first.

1058
01:24:15,396 --> 01:24:16,646
- Master Zhao.
- Don't worry.

1059
01:25:14,146 --> 01:25:15,188
- Master Zhao.
- Master Zhao.

1060
01:25:17,313 --> 01:25:18,146
Hey.

1061
01:25:18,229 --> 01:25:19,146
Who are you?

1062
01:25:26,854 --> 01:25:28,063
Wing Chun.

1063
01:25:28,104 --> 01:25:29,063
Ip Man.

1064
01:25:43,104 --> 01:25:46,479
Your Chinese kung fu
is nothing more than this.

1065
01:26:54,438 --> 01:26:56,229
- Master Ip!
- Master Ip!

1066
01:26:56,354 --> 01:26:57,438
Ip Man,

1067
01:26:57,896 --> 01:26:59,979
is this your limit?

1068
01:27:03,729 --> 01:27:05,146
The justice you defend

1069
01:27:05,188 --> 01:27:08,313
is just a joke in the face of power!

1070
01:27:10,938 --> 01:27:12,063
- Master Ip.
- Master Ip, get up.

1071
01:27:12,188 --> 01:27:13,813
- Master Ip!
- Hurry up and get up!

1072
01:27:13,979 --> 01:27:15,438
- We're counting on you!
- Stand up.

1073
01:27:15,563 --> 01:27:16,854
- Master Ip, stand up quickly!
- Master Ip!

1074
01:27:16,938 --> 01:27:18,021
- Master Ip!
- Master Ip!

1075
01:27:18,188 --> 01:27:21,021
- Master Ip!
- Master Ip, get up quickly!

1076
01:27:21,854 --> 01:27:24,271
- Avenge Director Xu!
- We believe in you, Master Ip!

1077
01:27:24,438 --> 01:27:25,979
- Master Ip!
- Stand up!

1078
01:27:26,021 --> 01:27:27,354
- Master Ip!
- Master Ip!

1079
01:27:27,521 --> 01:27:28,313
You can do it!

1080
01:27:43,354 --> 01:27:44,438
Okay.

1081
01:27:44,771 --> 01:27:46,271
Let's do one more round.

1082
01:28:32,729 --> 01:28:33,979
Master Ip won!

1083
01:28:34,063 --> 01:28:37,313
- Master Ip won!
- Master Ip won!

1084
01:28:37,396 --> 01:28:38,938
Master Ip won!

1085
01:28:42,396 --> 01:28:44,688
Tomorrow morning's newspaper headlines

1086
01:28:45,188 --> 01:28:46,563
will read,

1087
01:28:46,729 --> 01:28:49,979
"Ip Man led the way in trespassing
on British-owned territory.

1088
01:28:50,646 --> 01:28:52,729
The British side had
no choice but to fight back.

1089
01:28:53,479 --> 01:28:54,646
Ip Man was killed."

1090
01:28:58,729 --> 01:29:01,396
- Master Ip!
- Master Ip!

1091
01:29:02,563 --> 01:29:04,604
Are you all not afraid of death?

1092
01:29:04,771 --> 01:29:06,063
The Chinese are not afraid of death!

1093
01:29:06,188 --> 01:29:07,813
- That's right!
- The Chinese are not afraid of death!

1094
01:29:07,896 --> 01:29:10,229
- The Chinese are not afraid of death!
- The Chinese are not afraid of death!

1095
01:29:10,438 --> 01:29:11,396
Okay.

1096
01:29:11,646 --> 01:29:13,479
I'd like to see who dares to shoot!

1097
01:29:25,854 --> 01:29:27,104
Mr. Pike,

1098
01:29:27,354 --> 01:29:28,188
are you okay?

1099
01:29:28,354 --> 01:29:30,271
You've come just in time.

1100
01:29:31,229 --> 01:29:33,521
Hurry and arrest this escaped prisoner.

1101
01:29:40,979 --> 01:29:41,854
Take him away!

1102
01:29:42,438 --> 01:29:43,396
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

1103
01:29:46,604 --> 01:29:47,438
No.

1104
01:29:47,813 --> 01:29:49,271
You've got the wrong person.

1105
01:29:49,938 --> 01:29:51,063
It's not me. It's him!

1106
01:29:51,229 --> 01:29:52,271
Pike,

1107
01:29:52,354 --> 01:29:53,854
we now suspect your involvement

1108
01:29:53,896 --> 01:29:55,771
in multiple cases of illegal demolition,

1109
01:29:55,896 --> 01:29:59,188
death as a result of violence,
and bribery of officials.

1110
01:29:59,313 --> 01:30:01,188
Please cooperate with our investigation.

1111
01:30:01,896 --> 01:30:02,771
Take him away!

1112
01:30:05,354 --> 01:30:06,979
You have no right to arrest me.

1113
01:30:07,063 --> 01:30:08,438
I want to see the governor.

1114
01:30:08,479 --> 01:30:09,521
The governor?

1115
01:30:12,896 --> 01:30:14,313
Look closely.

1116
01:30:14,438 --> 01:30:16,813
This is an arrest warrant
personally signed by him.

1117
01:30:17,854 --> 01:30:19,938
Moreover, Lei Yihu has already
confessed everything.

1118
01:30:20,729 --> 01:30:21,979
If you surrender now,

1119
01:30:22,021 --> 01:30:23,396
you can still strive
for a reduced sentence.

1120
01:30:24,104 --> 01:30:26,563
If you continue to resist,
your fate will only be worse.

1121
01:30:27,229 --> 01:30:28,104
Take him away!

1122
01:30:29,104 --> 01:30:29,938
Let's go.

1123
01:30:30,063 --> 01:30:32,354
- I won't let you get away with this.
- You have no right to arrest me!

1124
01:30:32,771 --> 01:30:34,479
You'll regret this!

1125
01:30:34,521 --> 01:30:35,479
- Go.
- You...

1126
01:31:06,063 --> 01:31:08,104
Master Hong's real murderer
has been brought to justice!

1127
01:31:08,229 --> 01:31:10,188
The foreign businessman
got his just deserts!

1128
01:31:10,313 --> 01:31:12,396
Master Hong's real murderer
has been brought to justice!

1129
01:31:12,521 --> 01:31:14,938
The foreign businessman
got his just deserts!

1130
01:31:15,063 --> 01:31:17,188
Master Hong's real murderer
has been brought to justice!

1131
01:31:17,229 --> 01:31:19,063
The foreign businessman
got his just deserts!

1132
01:31:27,646 --> 01:31:29,729
Master Ip is here!

1133
01:31:34,521 --> 01:31:37,021
- Welcome, Master Ip!
- Welcome, Master Ip!

1134
01:31:38,604 --> 01:31:40,729
Thank you, everyone.

1135
01:31:41,771 --> 01:31:44,229
Master Ip, we've discussed it.

1136
01:31:44,313 --> 01:31:46,938
The position of association leader is
meant for you and no one else.

1137
01:31:47,021 --> 01:31:49,479
- Yes! It's meant for you!
- Yes! It's meant for you!

1138
01:31:49,521 --> 01:31:52,313
How am I worthy of
such an important responsibility?

1139
01:31:52,396 --> 01:31:54,729
Master Ip, please stop being modest.

1140
01:31:54,938 --> 01:31:58,229
This time, the Zhonghua Building was able
to be brought back from the brink.

1141
01:31:58,354 --> 01:32:00,771
It's all thanks to you
for stepping forward.

1142
01:32:02,021 --> 01:32:04,438
We are truly convinced
from the bottom of our hearts.

1143
01:32:04,563 --> 01:32:05,354
Isn't that right?

1144
01:32:05,479 --> 01:32:06,479
- Yes!
- Yes!

1145
01:32:06,563 --> 01:32:08,229
- We're convinced!
- We're convinced!

1146
01:32:08,271 --> 01:32:10,438
We will need your guidance

1147
01:32:10,563 --> 01:32:12,229
so they will learn the rules,

1148
01:32:12,354 --> 01:32:15,854
uphold martial virtues,
and not go astray like Lei Yihu.

1149
01:32:17,313 --> 01:32:19,771
Master Ip, please stop declining.

1150
01:32:20,771 --> 01:32:23,438
- Master Ip, don't decline anymore!
- Master Ip, don't decline anymore!

1151
01:32:25,438 --> 01:32:26,479
All right.

1152
01:32:26,563 --> 01:32:27,396
I agree.

1153
01:32:29,104 --> 01:32:30,146
All right!

1154
01:32:30,771 --> 01:32:32,813
- Bring out the lions!
- Bring out the lions!

1155
01:32:44,063 --> 01:32:45,979
Please. Please.

1156
01:32:54,979 --> 01:32:57,396
Master, please dot the lion's eyes!

1157
01:32:58,271 --> 01:32:59,313
Not again!

1158
01:33:02,604 --> 01:33:04,063
This time, it isn't a test.

1159
01:33:04,188 --> 01:33:07,438
We are sincerely inviting you
to dot the eyes of the Golden Lions

1160
01:33:07,563 --> 01:33:08,604
to awaken their roar!

1161
01:33:09,229 --> 01:33:10,604
- Please!
- All right.

1162
01:33:16,729 --> 01:33:17,979
Martial arts embody seven virtues.

1163
01:33:18,063 --> 01:33:20,604
Let's inscribe
the Seven Precepts of Martial Virtue.

1164
01:33:23,979 --> 01:33:25,396
First, prohibit violence
and restrain warfare.

1165
01:33:27,188 --> 01:33:28,729
Second, safeguard the greater good
and secure achievements.

1166
01:33:30,563 --> 01:33:32,063
Third, calm the people
and unite the masses.

1167
01:33:32,646 --> 01:33:34,688
Fourth, uphold fairness and impartiality.

1168
01:33:34,729 --> 01:33:35,813
- Great!
- Wonderful!

1169
01:33:35,938 --> 01:33:37,021
Fairness and impartiality!

1170
01:33:37,063 --> 01:33:39,188
- Excellent! Well said!
- Excellent!

1171
01:33:39,271 --> 01:33:40,771
- Good!
- Splendid!

1172
01:33:42,021 --> 01:33:44,604
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

1173
01:33:47,229 --> 01:33:50,438
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

1174
01:33:50,604 --> 01:33:51,729
Thank you all.

1175
01:33:51,854 --> 01:33:53,438
- Congratulations, Master Ip.
- Thank you.

1176
01:33:53,479 --> 01:33:55,521
Uncle Ip, I want
to learn martial arts too.

1177
01:33:55,563 --> 01:33:58,396
You said we should
protect our loved ones with our fists.

1178
01:33:58,479 --> 01:33:59,771
Then you must be willing
to endure hardship.

1179
01:34:00,563 --> 01:34:01,771
We're not afraid of hardship!

1180
01:34:01,813 --> 01:34:03,896
Mom says only through hardship
comes sweetness.

1181
01:34:07,021 --> 01:34:09,063
- Good!
- Congratulations!

1182
01:34:09,104 --> 01:34:11,563
- Congratulations, Master Ip.
- Please take your seat, Master.

1183
01:34:11,688 --> 01:34:13,271
- Congratulations!
- We want to learn martial arts too!

1184
01:34:16,396 --> 01:34:17,438
- Please.
- Please.

1185
01:34:19,021 --> 01:34:20,813
- Raise the lions.
- Raise the lions.

1186
01:34:23,229 --> 01:34:24,313
Master Zhao, please take a seat.

1187
01:34:24,979 --> 01:34:25,813
Please be seated.

1188
01:34:30,979 --> 01:34:34,104
- Bravo!
- Wonderful!

1189
01:34:36,104 --> 01:34:37,021
Good!

1190
01:34:37,146 --> 01:34:37,979
Bravo!

1191
01:34:40,104 --> 01:34:40,938
Bravo!

1192
01:34:41,854 --> 01:34:42,813
Look at this one.

1193
01:34:49,438 --> 01:34:52,521
Come, pet it for good luck.

1194
01:34:54,229 --> 01:34:55,021
It's wonderful.

1195
01:34:58,063 --> 01:34:58,938
Nice!

1196
01:34:59,604 --> 01:35:02,229
- Brilliant!
- Excellent!

1197
01:35:07,813 --> 01:35:09,188
Great!

1198
01:35:09,271 --> 01:35:11,563
{\an8}"The new leader inherits the seal
to promote martial arts!

1199
01:35:11,604 --> 01:35:13,688
{\an8}The majestic lion offers blessings
to celebrate the virtuous hero!"

1200
